meta {
  name: Create a receipt
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/general/receipts
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

body:multipart-form {
  name: Printing Receipts
  amount: 6666
  description: Printing flyers and registration materials
  file: @file(C:\Users\Maxmillian\Pictures\mmlogo.jpeg)
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Create a Receipt
  
  Uploads a receipt image to Cloudinary (under `/Cedarrise Initiative/DASHBOARD-ASSETS/RECEIPTS`) and creates a new receipt record in the database. Auto-populates `uploadedBy` with the authenticated user's name. Invalidates all cached receipts lists on success.
  
  ## Authorization
  
  - **Authentication:** Required — Bearer token via `authenticate()`.
  - **Permission:** `create` — enforced by `authorize("create")`.
  
  ## Request
  
  **Content-Type:** `multipart/form-data`
  
  ### Body Fields
  
  | Field         | Type   | Required | Validation                                                          |
  |---------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `name`        | string | ✅       | Min 3 characters, max 150 characters.                               |
  | `amount`      | number | ✅       | Must be an integer >= 1000.                                         |
  | `description` | string | ❌       | Optional description of the receipt.                                |
  | `file`        | file   | ✅       | Uploaded receipt image file (jpg, jpeg, png, webp). Max size 20 MB. |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the newly created receipt record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Receipt record created successfully",
    "data": {
      "id": "69d6a93c-25f2-4d52-8155-53025f0cb775",
      "name": "Printing Receipts",
      "amount": 12500,
      "description": "Printing flyers and registration materials",
      "uploadedBy": "admin",
      "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/...",
      "imagePublicId": "cloudinary_public_id",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-17T18:47:54.000Z",
      "updatedAt": null,
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Cache Invalidation
  
  - **Invalidated Keys:** Bypasses and deletes all caches matching pattern `cedarrise:general:receipts:*`
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                                 |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed (e.g. name too short, amount too low, file missing/invalid). |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid Bearer token.                                            |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Insufficient permissions.                                                   |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error or Cloudinary upload failure.                       |
}
